<p>Detail panels display row details alongside a table. Two modes: <strong>inline split-view</strong> (table shrinks, panel appears alongside) and <strong>overlay</strong> (panel slides over content).</p>

<!-- Load Detail Panel JS -->
<script src="/src/js/detail-panel.js"></script>

